<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Access Denied</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>🔗</text></svg>" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: "Inter", "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef2ff, #fce7f3);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #fff;
      max-width: 430px;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 42px 34px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.15);
      animation: rise 0.4s ease;
    }
    @keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
    .lock { font-size: 46px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    p { color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .who { color: #111827; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-all; }
    a.btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 18px;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 26px;
      transition: 0.25s;
    }
    a.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.35); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="lock">🔒</div>
    <h1>403 — Access Denied</h1>
    <p>This area contains sensitive server logs and is restricted to the owner of this application.</p>
    <p>Signed in as <span class="who"><%= typeof email !== 'undefined' ? email : 'guest' %></span></p>
    <a class="btn" href="/">← Back to Home</a>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
